# Cartridge RPC token (sk_...) authorizing RPC access from the browser.
# The Controller's session execution requires the Cartridge RPC, and
# Cartridge RPCs now require a token. Create with: slot rpc tokens create --team <team>
# Copy this file to .env for local dev; it is also injected by Vercel as env var CONTROLLER_RPC_KEY.
CONTROLLER_RPC_KEY=
